4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dKnKtuR3VOcQ7kNvwH8Vow9&_nc_oc=AdonZEwz5CHVWwq-jUB2WcmVf1xIruUU0SMOg45L6nRLug6XMwQTDGdIziq1VRRqErQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHGqUb5kyIVXBIwberbxtbA3-fP20E99fKTTLsqtM-XMw&oe=6A748654"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wmwNUzx6vD4Q7kNvwGOwLuF&_nc_oc=AdrqS7DcgnXNU0tLb7Wtofo5NBjAQYSf-wYed9hfYfr6cgkWNJWd13x-7e9QCBc8DHk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFuBZZ4gGi9dAmT94EGELpy5RSLVbNL2xfiVHhLtZz02w&oe=6A748B32"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nW0uaUYcoG0Q7kNvwGmS29B&_nc_oc=AdpGzWZRPIYM_ks4-Hi_9kB7yfa3HvtvYAROg2IIy3NiiN-5lTFBtyVkZ482TS1fp5Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEJeKOl3i4V-5AlVqyAxDJQ1B58gs8ooVobKnrfHEMqkw&oe=6A7498D5"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p